      "title": "Web3 套利第 14 天：91 篇笔记筛出五条铁律，4 天窗口高估 9.3 倍",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "第十四天消化 91 篇同学笔记，筛出五条带数字的铁律，最坑的一条是 4 天资金费窗口高估 9",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #333; background: #fff; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',serif}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;background:#1c1c1e;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:80px 90px 70px}\n.cover::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c9a96e,#e8d5b7,#c9a96e)}\n.cover::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:3px;left:40px;right:40px;height:1px;background:rgba(201,169,110,0.3)}\n.book-icon{position:absolute;top:50px;right:80px;width:120px;height:160px;border:2px solid rgba(201,169,110,0.3);border-radius:2px 8px 8px 2px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,169,110,0.08),rgba(201,169,110,0.02))}\n.book-icon::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:8px;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:rgba(201,169,110,0.15)}\n.book-spine{position:absolute;top:40px;right:195px;width:6px;height:170px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(201,169,110,0.2),rgba(201,169,110,0.05));border-radius:1px}\n.tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;color:#c9a96e;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.title{font-size:40px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.25;color:#f5f0e8;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:1px;max-width:620px}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a09580;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:30px;max-width:540px;font-style:italic}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding-top:24px}\n.author{font-size:14px;color:#8a8070;letter-spacing:1px}\n.dot{color:#c9a96e;margin:0 6px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body><div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"book-icon\"></div><div class=\"book-spine\"></div><div class=\"tag\">READING NOTES</div><h1 class=\"title\">Web3 套利第 14 天：91 篇笔记筛出五条铁律，4 天窗口高估 9.3 倍</h1><p class=\"subtitle\">第十四天消化 91 篇同学笔记，筛出五条带数字的铁律，最坑的一条是 4 天资金费窗口高估 9.3 倍。第二周自查收官，周认知定稿，D15 起节奏重排。</p><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div></div></body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">Web3 套利第 14 天：91 篇笔记筛出五条铁律，4 天窗口高估 9.3 倍</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #f8f8f8; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left: 4px solid #2c2c2c; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #888; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 14 天\n2026-08-18</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">第十三天给管线装上大脑，第十四天是消化日加收官日。上午把 91 篇同学笔记全部归档、分章、交叉校验，筛出五条带数字的铁律。下午对照 21 天产出总表做第二周自查，五条周认知定稿，D15 到 D19 的节奏全部重排。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">一、91 篇笔记，五条铁律</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">3 个子代理并行精读，人工再抽 9 篇交叉校验，最后合成一份 digest。这 91 篇里最强的五条线。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">铁律</span>RWA 基差</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>Tokenized Stock × Hyperliquid HIP-3，Long NVDAx + Short xyz:NVDA 赚基差收敛，周末 P/X−1=2.88%，两市场争夺价格发现权</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>币股线从「时钟差」升级为「RWA 基差」</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">铁律</span>资金费短窗口骗人</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>BILL 4 天窗口 +126%，拉满 88 天只有 +13.57%，高估 9.3 倍</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>funding 监控补「短窗口对比 + 换手率」两列</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">铁律</span>gas 全额计</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>Monad gasLimit 不退回，成本按 gasLimit × gasPrice 全额计算，1.2x 系数后要重算利润</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>成本模型模板新增「gas 语义检查」步骤</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">铁律</span>测量自我污染</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>「速度溢价 51bps」是自己填的 0.5% 滑点被 toAmountMin 读回，修正后只有 1.0-1.1bps</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>扫描器自查清单补「测量自我污染」条</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">铁律</span>原子性≠执行权</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">一句话</span>bundle 不保证 top-of-block，竞价让渡 95% 后净剩 0.04 ETH</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">落到我们管线的动作</span>evidence-tracker 补「拒绝原因分布 + 决策版本号」列</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">每一条都带互证、带数字、带落地动作。比如最炸的一条，资金费短窗口。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">二、最坑的铁律，4 天窗口高估 9.3 倍</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">「年化 43.8% 收租」这类结论，很大概率来自短窗口外推。BILL 这个标的，4 天窗口看着 +126%，拉满 88 天真实只有 +13.57%，高估 9.3 倍。为什么，因为资金费符号每个月翻转几十次，高费率是事件不是常态。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">筛选判据有四条，同号占比不低于 70%，历史劈两半不反号，30 天能回本，换手率不高于 50%。四条全过，费率信号才敢信。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">生活类比，一个人一周减了 3 斤，按这个速度外推一年能减 156 斤，现实是他 88 天只减了 4 斤。短窗口外推，永远是韭菜的起点。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">三、第二周自查，五条周认知定稿</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">下午对照 21 天产出总表逐项打勾。监控脚本 ✓，AMM 数学 ✓，模拟器 ✓，Jito pipeline 🟡 半完成，mainnet 闭环跑通、套利逻辑已接、差实盘纪律。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">两周下来，周认知收敛成五条。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">常驻价差早被磨平，肉在事件窗口和机制错位。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">成本模型要按链定制，Monad gasLimit 不退回，其他链的估算公式直接搬过去会算错利润。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">测量会自我污染，脚本里填的滑点参数会被结果读回去，验证参数前先问一句，这个变量真的在让该变的变吗。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">原子性不等于执行权，bundle 进得去区块不代表站得住位置，expected_net 等于 P(纳入) 乘 landed_net 减基建成本。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">币股线从「时钟差」升级成「RWA 基差」，股票代币在 Solana 上了，Jito 管线可以直接复用。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">五条里最值钱的是最后一条。Tokenized Stock 和 Hyperliquid 的 HIP-3 基差，Long NVDAx 加 Short xyz 的 NVDA，赚的是基差收敛、funding 和微观结构错位。log(P/X) 等于 log(P/O) 加 log(O/X)，价格发现权在两市场之间来回争夺，周末 NVDAx 从 100 涨到 104，HIP-3 跟到 107，P/X 减 1 有 2.88%。机会存在置信度 90%，币股线研究分支就此独立成线。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">四、落地三件事</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">digest 的 8 条可执行增量，三条先落地。币股线新增 RWA 基差分支，xStocks 已在 Solana，Jito 管线可复用。funding 监控补两列，短窗口对比和换手率。成本模型模板新增 gas 语义检查步骤，每笔预算先确认 gas 是退回还是全额计。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">五、明天做什么</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">第二周收成三件事，91 篇笔记浓缩成五条铁律，第二周自查表定稿，三条增量落地。明天的功课，D15 加 gas 语义检查前置，D16 加失败分类日志，D19 币股方向升级成 RWA 基差框架。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">第十四天收盘，第二周收官。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">关于本次共学</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin:24px 0;padding:0;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:10px 14px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.12em;\">📌 关于本次共学</p>\n<section style=\"padding:14px 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#1a1a1a;\">本系列来自「<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">链上套利残酷共学</strong>」，由 Bruce Xu 发起，<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">21 天实践型共学</strong>（2026.08.05 至 08.26），<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">571 位伙伴</strong>围绕机会发现、成本验证、策略构建、信号监控与执行复盘，用真实证据逼近答案，不做只听概念不落地的学习。\n\n🔗 活动详情 <a href=\"https://intensivecolearn.ing/programs/b43d2e97-ed88-4ca3-b12f-7ef672b01205\" style=\"color:#2c2c2c;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;word-break:break-all;\">https://intensivecolearn.ing/programs/b43d2e97-ed88-4ca3-b12f-7ef672b01205</a></section>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:3em;padding-top:2em;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0;color:#888;font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">— · —</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">寻月隐君</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;\">专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。<br>\n技术的光，未来的道。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:left;line-height:1.8;\">本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0 0.6em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">长按下方二维码即可入阁。若二维码过期，请在公众号后台回复 加群 获取最新二维码。</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/22kVflKPKaySVtDOicT0JQtdNS6zCoDUx2qRaD3mZsK4v4g5b6zMwnN2RhmvxjK4nwp5lwLu7MHicY6nTk0HickbyGmflntdUicksCojQWGDRGg/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:80%;width:240px;height:auto;\" alt=\"群二维码\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKawRJpyVCFC6Y33G28DRQoV8lXARCYOGytWnWUyT3gStL3ibvy2ibvsxl7ImoRrUcI5YH5pkm3J86jCHNKYia6zyCsYp07TiaCtHLJM/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" alt=\"关注\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.8em 0;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">关注《寻月隐君》，一起在技术的星空下寻找属于自己的明月。</p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
